# Optional. If set, the Status section shows a small live badge with the
# reference testnet contract's real current status, read from api/. Left
# unset, that badge just never renders -- no error, no stuck loading
# state, since there's no deployed API for the public site to reach yet.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# VITE_BUILD_SHA isn't set here: vite.config.ts injects it at build time
# from VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA/GITHUB_SHA (or git), and its `define`
# overrides any value placed in this file. Leaving it unset is normal --
# it only drives the footer's build stamp, and the footer just omits that
# when no SHA is available.
